{
  "meta": {
    "source": "Airship engagement-review skill — CRM campaign playbook (best-practice campaign levers per pillar x vertical)",
    "created": "2026-07-22",
    "notes": "Maps a client's campaigns to a strategic PILLAR + standard campaign LEVER so the report can show what the client already does, how mature each pillar is, and which new campaigns to recommend. Detection is name-first (bilingual EN/FR token/alias overlap) with an optional content fallback (decoded perpush/pushbody notif text / MC HTML). Relevance per vertical: relevance(lever, vertical) = levers[].verticals.get(vertical, levers[].base); a lever is 'recommended for the vertical' when relevance >= 3. This catalog is guidance, not the client's data. Reports API only — content used for detection comes from decoded pushbodies, never the Content API."
  },
